     "periodStartPrecision": "day",
     "periodEndPrecision": "day",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "出身與軍旅早年",
      "en": "Origins and early army career"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "莫罕·辛格1909年1月3日生於錫亞爾科特附近的烏戈克村，父親在他出生前兩個月去世。他中學畢業後，1927年加入英屬印度軍第14旁遮普團，1931年被選為軍官候補，1934年2月1日獲任軍官。1936年2月24日，他被派到第14旁遮普團第1營，其後升任上尉，1941年3月4日隨部隊前往馬來亞。",
      "en": "Mohan Singh was born on 3 January 1909 at Ugoke village near Sialkot, and his father died two months before his birth. After high school he joined the 14th Punjab Regiment of the Indian army in 1927, was selected as a potential officer in 1931, and was commissioned on 1 February 1934. On 24 February 1936 he was posted to the 1st Battalion, 14th Punjab Regiment; he was later promoted Captain and left for Malaya with his unit on 4 March 1941."
     },
