     },
     "periodStartPrecision": "day",
     "periodEndPrecision": "day",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "日得拉戰敗與法勒公園",
      "en": "Defeat at Jitra and Farrer Park"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "辛格的營在吉打州日得拉（Jitra）被入侵的日軍擊潰。1941年12月15日，他在瓜拉囊（Kuala Nerang）附近的橡膠園與藤原岩市少佐等人會面，起初有所保留，後來同意組建印度國民軍，該軍於12月31日在太平（Taiping）成立。1942年2月15日新加坡陷落，2月17日約四萬名印度戰俘聚集於法勒公園（Farrer Park），藤原把責任與指揮權移交給辛格，辛格以印地語演說，說明要組建印度國民軍，並邀請眾人加入。",
      "en": "Mohan Singh’s battalion was overpowered by the invading Japanese forces at Jitra in Kedah. On 15 December 1941 he met Major Fujiwara and others in a rubber plantation near Kuala Nerang; he initially had reservations but relented, and the INA was formed at Taiping on 31 December 1941. Singapore was captured on 15 February 1942; on 17 February 40,000 Indian prisoners of war gathered at Farrer Park, where Fujiwara passed responsibility and command to Mohan Singh, who spoke in Hindi of forming an Indian National Army and invited the troops to join it."
     },
