    {
     "ord": 3,
     "period": {
      "start": "1942-06-15",
      "end": "1942-12-30"
     },
     "periodStartPrecision": "day",
     "periodEndPrecision": "day",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "出任總司令與遭免職",
      "en": "Commander-in-Chief and removal"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "印度獨立聯盟於1942年6月15日至23日在曼谷召開會議，會中通過35項決議，其中一項正式任命辛格為總司令。他與聯盟領袖拉什·比哈里·鮑斯之間出現衝突，辛格認為鮑斯是日本的工具；他與日軍司令部往來後，漸漸對日方的真實意圖起疑，並認識到日方的目標並非印度獨立。與部分日軍高階將領意見不合後，國民軍於1942年12月下旬被解散，辛格12月29日被免除指揮權，遭日本憲兵隊逮捕，並被流放到烏敏島（Pulau Ubin）受監管。",
      "en": "The Indian Independence League held a conference in Bangkok from 15 to 23 June 1942 at which thirty-five resolutions were passed, one formally appointing Mohan Singh as Commander-in-Chief. Conflict arose between Rash Bihari Bose and Mohan Singh, who felt that Bose was a tool of Japan. In dealing with Japanese army headquarters he began to doubt their real intentions and came to realize that the Japanese agenda was not Indian independence. After disagreements with senior Japanese commanders the INA was disbanded towards the end of December 1942; Mohan Singh was removed from his command on 29 December, taken into custody by the Kempeitai and exiled to Pulau Ubin."
     },
