    {
     "ord": 4,
     "period": {
      "start": "1945-05-01",
      "end": "1989-12-27"
     },
     "periodStartPrecision": "month",
     "periodEndPrecision": "day",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "戰後與晚年",
      "en": "Postwar years and death"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1945年5至6月間，包括辛格在內的印度國民軍多數官兵被英軍俘虜並送回印度。1947年2月他加入印度國民大會黨，並在旁遮普擔任議員，後來當選聯邦院（Rajya Sabha），任期兩屆。他在議會內外都爭取國民軍成員被承認為自由鬥士。1989年12月26日，他在盧迪亞納附近的朱吉亞納村去世。",
      "en": "During May–June 1945 most officers and men of the INA, including General Mohan Singh, were made prisoners by the British and brought back to India. He joined the Indian National Congress in February 1947 and served as a legislator in Punjab; he was also elected to the Rajya Sabha and served for two terms. In and out of Parliament he strove for the recognition of the members of his Azad Hind Fauj as freedom fighters. He died at Jugiana on 26 December 1989."
     },
